# 🏘️ Village Markers Feature — Full Status Report

## What Was Requested

Show intermediate villages (e.g. Bandukheri, Khera Afgan) that lie between bus stops on a route. These are NOT official stops — they're small settlements the bus passes through. Show them as amber dots with labels on the map, connected to the route with dotted lines.

