## ⚠️ Known Issues / Risks

| Issue | Impact | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Overpass returns only villages in OSM database | Some small settlements might be missing from OSM | Can't fix — OSM data quality varies by region |
| Route polyline is straight-line between stops | Villages near the actual curved road but far from the straight line may be excluded | Increase `maxDistanceKm` (currently 5) or add road-snapped waypoints |
| Backend logs `waypoints.json not found` at startup | Village waypoints in `routeGeometry.ts` are empty (but this is separate from the Overpass-based village markers) | Run `scripts/fetch_osm_villages.ts` to generate, or ignore — the new village system doesn't need it |
| PostgreSQL not connected (falling back to mock DB) | Not related to villages — affects live trip data | Set up PostgreSQL or continue with mock data |

