## 🔧 API Reference

### GET `/api/v1/routes/:routeId/villages`

| Param | Type | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `routeId` | path | required | Route ID from the routes table |
| `maxDistanceKm` | query | 5 | Max perpendicular distance from route polyline |

**Response:**
```json
{
  "villages": [
    { "name": "Bandukheri", "latitude": 29.972, "longitude": 77.553 },
    { "name": "Khera Afgan", "latitude": 29.975, "longitude": 77.551 }
  ],
  "_meta": { "source": "cache|overpass|stale_cache", "count": 2 }
}
```

### POST `/api/v1/routes/:routeId/villages/refresh`
Forces a fresh Overpass fetch and replaces the cache.

